*> Test of 33 section 9, Difficulty (core/src/worldsim-33.cob; T0515): setDifficulty with its lock and hardcore rule, damage scaling, the difficulty sites of 9.3 and the time and moon inputs of local difficulty.
*> A case loads its inputs from a text of numbers (LOAD-IN fills WS-I as integers and WS-FX as doubles), calls the program
*> and shows the outputs WS-R(1..WS-N) joined by "/", one group per call; expected values come from the rules and tables of the section.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-WORLDSIM-33-9.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY INTERACT.
 01 WS-ISG.
